    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Toru Muranishi comes home at last to surprise his young son Daisuke and wife Mayumi with a birthday gift. Their warm family reunion lasts only moments before Takei's investigators ring the front doorbell. Listen to the classic Japanese homecoming greetings first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ただいま！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "おかえり、パパ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "元気にしてたか？会いたかったぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "元気だよ。パパ、久しぶりだね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "おばあちゃん、パパが帰ってきたよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ほら、誕生日プレゼントだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "やった！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "廊下で遊んできていい？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いいよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "これからもたまに会ってくれる？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、もちろんだ、真由美。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "新しい仕事、どう？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "中に入っとけ！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Few scenes pack in so many everyday family essentials—from stepping through the front door to asking permission to play. Let's hear them up close.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ただいま！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am home!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "おかえり、パパ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Welcome home, Dad!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "元気にしてたか？会いたかったぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you been well? I missed you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "パパ、久しぶりだね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It has been a long time, Dad.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "おばあちゃん、パパが帰ってきたよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Grandma, Dad came home!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ほら、誕生日プレゼントだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look, it is a birthday present.'",
      "gap": 0.45
