    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Homecoming pair \"tadaima\" and \"okaeri\", reunion favorite \"hisashiburi\", and \"aitakatta\" for 'I missed you' are four of the warmest everyday expressions in Japanese—even as Episode Two ends on a cliffhanger. Until next episode, see you tomorrow.",
